Let me restructure the rubric totals to compute per-scope totals:

```python
def by_scope(counts):
    out={"kept":0,"excluded":0,"staging":0}
    for k,v in counts.items():
        cls=classify(k)
        if cls in ("historical","snapshot_copy"): out["excluded"]+=v
        elif cls=="staging_unresolved": out["staging"]+=v
        else: out["kept"]+=v
    return out
```

